Ripple
======

Third-party code
----------------

Ripple/Number/Milla/ (Basic, Periodicity, BernoulliValues, Estimates, Ramanujan, PicardFuchs,
Clausen, Kummer, MainTheorem) is ported from Lean Pool
(https://github.com/LeanPool/lean-pool, directory LeanPool/Chudnovsky, commit 6b28d23e),
which imported it from https://github.com/ldct/lean-eval-chudnovsky.

  Copyright (c) 2026 Xuanji Li. All rights reserved.
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
  (http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).

The port keeps the copyright and license header of every file. Changes (stated at the top of each
ported file): module-system syntax removed, namespace `Chudnovsky` renamed
`Ripple.Number.Milla`, and the proofs adapted to the Mathlib version pinned by Ripple.
The mathematics follows C. Milla, "A detailed proof of the Chudnovsky formula with means of
basic complex analysis" (arXiv:1809.00533).

Ripple/Stochastic/ (the L2 Ito integral: ItoIntegralCLM, ItoIntegralL2, ItoIntegralL2Dense, ItoIntegralProcess,
ItoIntegralProcessGeneral, ItoIntegralProcessIsometry, ItoIntegralProcessMartingale, ItoIntegralCovariation,
ItoIsometryAdapted, WienerIntegral, WienerIntegralL2) is ported from formal-mathfin
(https://github.com/formal-applied-math/formal-mathfin, directory MathFin/Foundations, commit c1b03161).

  Copyright (c) 2026 Raphael Coelho. All rights reserved.
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
  (http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).

Ripple/Stochastic/BrownianMotion/ (Auxiliary, Continuity, Gaussian and StochasticIntegral modules) is ported from
BrownianMotion by Rémy Degenne and contributors (https://github.com/RemyDegenne/brownian-motion, commit eaa43913), and
Ripple/Stochastic/KolmogorovExtension4/ (CompactSystem, RegularContent, KolmogorovExtension) from the Kolmogorov
extension theorem project kolmogorov_extension4 (https://github.com/RemyDegenne/kolmogorov_extension4, commit c1815253).

  Copyright (c) 2023 Rémy Degenne. All rights reserved.
  Copyright (c) 2025 Rémy Degenne. All rights reserved.
  Copyright (c) 2025 Etienne Marion. All rights reserved.
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
  (http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).

The port keeps the copyright and license header of every file that has one (the BrownianMotion files without a header
are covered by the Apache-2.0 LICENSE of that repository). Changes (stated at the top of each ported file):
module-system syntax removed, imports renamed to Ripple.Stochastic.*, and, in the formal-mathfin files, namespace
`MathFin` renamed `Ripple.Stochastic.MathFin`.
No proof text was changed. The BrownianMotion and kolmogorov_extension4 files keep their declaration names and their
Mathlib-namespace extensions (for example `ProbabilityTheory`, `MeasureTheory`, `Finset`) unchanged, because wrapping
them in a Ripple namespace would break dot-notation on Mathlib types.
